    <bpmn:task id="task_1omd6cn9" name="Upgraded runway &#38; surfaces" dai:notes="terrain.ts: Airfield gets paved/pavedWidth; RUNWAY = 900 m × 30 m asphalt, 15 m grass shoulders, 60 m grass overruns (1020 × 60 total). scoreSite samples ±510 m × ±90 m; FLAT_A 40, FLAT_B 110. surfaceAt() → paved | grass | rough | water. Median terrain cut under the strip rose from 7.7 m to 12.2 m (p90 12 → 23 m), still fine for the cartoon look, so the &#39;gentle slope&#39; allowance was not needed. airfieldProps.ts: mowed grass base, asphalt, threshold bars + piano keys, seven-segment runway numbers from the heading (HUD compass convention), dashed centreline, touchdown-zone and aiming bars, edge lights (green at the ends) and PAPI (4 lights per end, live red/white from the player&#39;s glide angle; checked: 3° → RRWW), jet-sized arched hangars with open doors, apron and taxiway; dispose() added. flight.ts: per-wheel grip/rolling friction by surface and tyre. Spawn moved to 20 m inside the paved threshold. Test: &#39;runway fits the terrain on 200 seeds&#39; (flat ±1 m, never over water, paved/grass surfaces, home within 7 km)." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_rpikw3qw">
