    <bpmn:task id="task_imeu4ufw" name="Loadout tests &#38; verification" dai:notes="vitest 43/43: flight (6, unchanged), world (6, incl. runway on 200 seeds), loadout (31: default == original spec, 216 combos, parse/sanitise, 27 flight combos take off ≤ 630 m and land ≤ 750 m roll with no crash, stat ranking). tsc + vite build OK (600 KB main, 163 KB gzip). Chrome at localhost:5288: three styles spawn on asphalt resting on their gear (3 wheels) and roll straight at full throttle for 8 s; landing → debrief shows the aircraft row; back to hangar rebuilds the preview; PAPI angles correct; no console errors. Screenshots via the extension timed out, so visuals were checked with canvas captures. Not done: a hand-flown landing in each airframe, audio by ear." dai:agentStatus="done" dai:planRef="task_07tcv09h">
